<title>TURKEY: Turkish 392-day bond yield dives to 123.66 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkish 392-day bond yield dives to 123.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 392-day bond yield dived to 123.66 percent in a Treasury auction on Tuesday, down 12.66 points from the previous 9-mth t-bill auction on December 3.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    : Jan 14, 1998</p>
<p>	Amount			: 181.3 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     : 123.66</p>
<p>	Average yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  : 478.0 trln lira</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   : 42,026 lira</p>
<p>	Pct allocated at lowest price : -</p>
<p>	Payment date		: December 18, 1996</p>
<p>--Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
